    },
    {
      "end": 62.36000061035156,
      "text": "The truth in your lies, lies within you",
      "start": 58.08000183105469
    },
    {
      "end": 65.77999877929688,
      "text": "Lies, the truth of all you do",
      "start": 62.36000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 69.5,
      "text": "The truth in your lies, lies within you",
      "start": 65.77999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 73.31999969482422,
      "text": "We have the truth of all you do",
      "start": 70.0199966430664
    },
    {
      "end": 78.26000213623047,
      "text": "Undercutting different levels, different moments that you swore on us",
      "start": 73.80000305175781
    },
    {
      "end": 86.76000213623047,
      "text": "But you lied to get out the comatic retribution coming over you",
      "start": 78.26000213623047
    },
    {
      "end": 91.37999725341797,
      "text": "So don't bow to the pressure, the hate to feel",
      "start": 86.86000061035156
    },
    {
      "end": 94.4800033569336,
      "text": "Come and relate, empathy's the deal",
      "start": 91.37999725341797
    },
    {
      "end": 97.13999938964844,
      "text": "If you stay close to you",
      "start": 94.4800033569336
    },
    {
      "end": 101.41999816894531,
      "text": "And don't lie your truth away in the night",
      "start": 97.13999938964844
    },
    {
      "end": 135.1999969482422,
      "text": "The truth in your lies",
      "start": 131.66000366210938
    },
    {
      "end": 137.27999877929688,
      "text": "Ace of hearts",
      "start": 136.02000427246094
    },
    {
      "end": 151.0800018310547,
      "text": "The truth lies within your lies, lies within you",
      "start": 146.77999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 155.97999572753906,
      "text": "The truth lies within your lies, lies within you",
      "start": 151.0800018310547
    },
    {
      "end": 160.39999389648438,
      "text": "The truth lies within you",
      "start": 156.66000366210938
    },
    {
      "end": 162.4199981689453,
      "text": "In the night you fight",
      "start": 160.66000366210938
    },
    {
      "end": 165.27999877929688,
      "text": "Everything you thought was positive was the best",
      "start": 162.4199981689453
    },
    {
      "end": 169.6999969482422,
      "text": "But then you come back around and don't even try to",
      "start": 165.27999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 174.82000732421875,
      "text": "Heal the seal, the feel of your momentary come up",
      "start": 169.6999969482422
    },
    {
      "end": 177.10000610351562,
      "text": "Are you for real?",
      "start": 174.82000732421875
    },
    {
      "end": 181.3800048828125,
      "text": "Yeah",
      "start": 180.6199951171875
    },
    {
      "end": 185.72000122070312,
      "text": "Lies are the truth, the truth in your lies",
      "start": 181.3800048828125
    },
    {
      "end": 190.6199951171875,
      "text": "I'll see you on the other side",
      "start": 187.0800018310547
    },
    {
      "end": 193.97999572753906,
      "text": "Just don't bring that disguise that hides",
      "start": 190.6199951171875
    },
    {
      "end": 196.22000122070312,
      "text": "That curates your existence",
      "start": 193.97999572753906
    },
    {
      "end": 199.10000610351562,
      "text": "Try to break above that",
      "start": 196.22000122070312
    },
    {
      "end": 201.33999633789062,
      "text": "God is in your truth",
      "start": 199.10000610351562
    },
    {
      "end": 203.94000244140625,
      "text": "What lies within you?",
      "start": 201.33999633789062
    },
    {
      "end": 207.8000030517578,
      "text": "Lies within you",
      "start": 205.3800048828125
    },
    {
